Package: linopt
Version: 1.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LinOpt Maintainers <admin@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, policykit-1
Recommends: linux-cpupower, snapd
Description: GTK desktop utility for Linux system maintenance
 LinOpt provides manual CPU governor controls, APT cleanup, system journal
 maintenance, auto-cpufreq configuration, and an optional weekly systemd timer.
